# Note: model_config = ConfigDict(from_attributes=True)
# This line is needed for any schema where you grab something from the database
# because the code cannot read it without it. Then it'll automatically grab whatever
# attributes it can find that was defined in your base model. Oftentimes you may need
# to add id: because it's not in your base model, usually.
# You don't need it for Create/Update, only Read/Response